---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL, sitePath } from "../lib/site";
const commands = `git clone ${GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}.git tung-tung-tung-code\ncd tung-tung-tung-code\npnpm install\npnpm dev`;
---
<Layout title="Enter the village | Tung Tung Tung Code" description="Run the Sahur-themed coding-agent workspace from source. No misleading upstream installers.">
  <section class="get-code">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE FIRST KNOCK / GET STARTED</p>
    <h1>Your village.<br /><em>Your machine.</em></h1>
    <p class="intro">Tung Tung Tung Code is currently a source-build fork. There are no official Sahur desktop binaries or app-store releases yet. The code is the download.</p>
    <div class="source-panel"><div class="source-heading"><span>01 / CLONE. INSTALL. AWAKEN.</span><button id="copy-setup" type="button">Copy commands</button></div><pre><code id="setup-commands">{commands}</code></pre><p>Use the Node and pnpm versions in <a href={`${GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}/blob/main/package.json`}>package.json</a>. Authenticate at least one coding-agent CLI on your machine first.</p></div>
    <div class="next-steps"><article><span>02 / THE WEBSITE</span><h2>Run this very village.</h2><p>From the repository root, start the dedicated Astro website:</p><pre><code>pnpm --filter @t3tools/marketing dev</code></pre></article><article><span>03 / THE LORE</span><h2>Find your first secret.</h2><p>Open the workspace, find ☾ SAHUR in the corner, and knock three times. There are 17 discoveries. Your editor and terminal are off-limits to secret typing.</p><a href={sitePath("/#secrets")}>Read the field notes ↗</a></article></div>
    <p class="source-note">This fork keeps upstream package and protocol identifiers where integrations depend on them. That’s compatibility, not a secret installation of the original app.</p>
    <a class="repository-link" href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}>Browse the repository ↗</a>
    <p id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
<script>
  document.getElementById("copy-setup")?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    const source = document.getElementById("setup-commands");
    const status = document.getElementById("copy-status");
    if (!source || !status) return;
    try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(source.textContent ?? ""); status.textContent = "Copied. The guardian approves."; }
    catch { status.textContent = "Clipboard unavailable. Select and copy the commands above."; }
  });
</script>
<style>
  .get-code { max-width: 1040px; padding: 75px 6% 100px; margin: auto; }
  .eyebrow, .next-steps article > span { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--accent); }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.06em; margin: 30px 0; }
  h1 em { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; color: var(--accent); }
  .intro { font-size: 17px; max-width: 620px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 45px; }
  .source-panel { border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #1a130e; padding: 28px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .source-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 15px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  button { color: var(--bg); background: var(--accent); border: 0; padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 11px; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font: 12px/2 var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); }
  .source-panel p, .source-note { font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .next-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 45px; padding: 45px 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-weight: 500; }
  .next-steps p, .next-steps a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .repository-link { display: inline-block; color: var(--accent); margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
  #copy-status { font-size: 12px; min-height: 20px; }
  @media(max-width: 600px) { .get-code { padding-top: 45px; } .source-panel { padding: 18px; } .source-heading { letter-spacing: 0; } .next-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 25px; } }
</style>
